# 🧠 MindShield

### A Mental Wellness & Support Platform for College Students

MindShield is a **privacy-focused mental wellness platform designed for college students**. It helps students regularly assess and monitor their well-being through mental wellness assessments, mood tracking, habit tracking, sleep and study tracking, while also providing access to counselor support when required.

The goal of MindShield is to make mental wellness support **more accessible, private, and approachable** for students.

---

## ✨ Features

### 📝 Weekly Mental Wellness Assessment

Students can complete regular wellness assessments to reflect on their mental and emotional well-being.

### 📊 Risk-Based Support

The platform evaluates assessment responses and categorizes students based on their level of support needed, helping provide appropriate next steps.

### 😊 Mood Tracker

Students can record their daily mood and maintain a personal record of their emotional well-being.

### 😴 Sleep Tracker

Students can track their sleeping hours and monitor their sleep patterns.

### 📚 Study Tracker

Allows students to record their study hours and maintain a healthier balance between academics and personal well-being.

### ✅ Habit Tracker

Students can track their daily habits and work towards building healthier routines.

### 👩‍⚕️ Counselor Dashboard

Counselors can access an organized dashboard to monitor students assigned to them and provide appropriate support.

### 🔐 Privacy-Focused Profiles

Students can use **nicknames** within the platform, helping protect their identity while interacting with counselors.

### 💬 Student-Counselor Support

The platform provides different levels of support depending on the student's assessment results and needs.

---

## 🔄 How It Works

```text
        Student Registration
                ↓
       Weekly Assessment
                ↓
      Risk & Support Evaluation
                ↓
       Support Level Identified
                ↓
     ┌──────────┴──────────┐
     ↓                     ↓
Wellness Tracking     Counselor Support
     ↓                     ↓
Mood • Sleep •       Guidance & Interaction
Study • Habits
```

MindShield follows a **proactive approach to mental wellness**, encouraging students to regularly understand their well-being instead of seeking help only when problems become severe.

---

## 🎯 Problem Statement

College students often experience academic pressure, stress, irregular sleep schedules, changing routines, and difficulty reaching out for mental health support.

Many students may also hesitate to seek help because of **privacy concerns or fear of being judged**.

MindShield aims to address these challenges by providing a student-friendly platform where users can:

* Regularly assess their well-being
* Track everyday wellness habits
* Identify changes in their mental wellness
* Maintain privacy through nickname-based profiles
* Seek counselor support when needed

---

